  "details": "ClientSim is unusable in the latest beta on desktop due to mouse movement inputs being clamped to -1 < x < 1.\n\nMovement speed gets clamped at less than 1/25 of the speed I'm used to moving my mouse, resulting in extremely slow turning and up/down movement.\n\nRemoving Axis Deadzone processor in the ClientSim input mapping fixes the issue and reverts desktop mouse movement to how it used to be.",
